":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical","Arts"],"flavourText":"A special Arts creation from the Dublinn forces, created by their leader Mandragora. According to Mandragora, back when she was studying Originium Arts in an outskirts cemetery, the Tombkeeper Grotesque was her first companion. Its outer appearance has gone through many redesigns, with the latest being based off a Sarkaz from an ancient bloodline. This series of Tombkeepers embodies Mandragora's fury towards Victoria.","abilities":["After first defeat, temporarily transforms into a stone statue with extremely high DEF, then revives as an aerial unit","Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":750,"def":750,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"mudrock_zealot_leader":{"slug":"mudrock_zealot_leader","name":"Mudrock Zealot Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mudrock Zealot Leader.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An elite of Mudrock's Sarkaz squad. Dancing on the edge of life and death has led them to develop a unique tactical system. Using Arts Resonance, they can generate a Barrier that absorbs Arts damage and grants additional Max HP and ASPD while it persists.","abilities":["Has a Barrier that absorbs Arts damage.","Max HP and ASPD significantly increases while the Barrier persists."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":13000,"atk":1000,"def":800,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"theater_golem":{"slug":"theater_golem","name":"Theater Golem","icon":"/enemies-icons/Theater Golem.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Arts Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A gigantic golem maintained by the Crimson Troupe's prop department, they are normally used to move bulky items. They are massive and difficult to block.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by units with at least 4 Block","Attacks deal Splash damage to allied units in a small area around self"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":24000,"atk":1200,"def":300,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"jetman":{"slug":"jetman","name":"Jetman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Jetman.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"One of the dessert-time jokes among Columbians involves a strange man who calls himself a 'Master Thief,' puttering around with a self-made jetpack. The most valuable thing he's stolen is a single burdenbeast. However, the fact that he made his own jetpack might mean that he really is a master.","abilities":["When blocked, this unit will take off for a period of time (this effect has a cooldown)"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":58000,"atk":400,"def":280,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}}},"dropIcons":{},"previewFile":"ro1_b_7.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[],"playbackPaths":{"1":{"points":[[6,5],[12,1]],"distances":[0,7.211102550927979],"length":7.211102550927979,"breaks":[],"flying":false,"holds":[],"nodes":[[6,5],[12,1]]}},"family":[{"slug":"isw-df_level_obt_roguelike_ro1_level_rogue1_b-7","code":"ISW-DF","name":"All I Ask of You","stageType":"integrated_strategies","variant":null,"variantOf":null,"contentId":"rogue_1","contentLabel":"IS2","contentName":"Phantom & Crimson Solitaire","order":42,"hasBoss":true,"zoneName":"Phantom & Crimson Solitaire"}]}